      "message": "Question is, if should we connect Audio Active State with BIG existence or with real audio state (onAudioResume/onAudioSuspend) or both?\n\nRight now there is a big difference in that, because BIG is always on, but music could be stopped. Only on call handover BIG is stopped.\n\nIn the next approach we will terminate BIG on onAudioSuspend but after some time (30s?) so there still will be a difference but little smaller.\n\nRight now there is a 5s gap between media pause and onAudioSuspend.\n\nSo i.e. it can look like this:\n\nmediaPause \u003e 5s \u003e onAudioSuspend \u003e audioActiveState false \u003e 30s \u003e BIG termination\nor\nmediaPause \u003e 5s \u003e onAudioSuspend \u003e 30s \u003e BIG termination \u003e audioActiveState false\n\nI tied it with BIG existence right now, but what is your opinion?",
